  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome mapping seminar in Palestine, September 2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Outcome mapping seminar in Palestine, September 2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Generalkonsulatet i Jerusalem planerar att genomf&#xf6;ra en utbildningen i Outcome Mapping som kommer att h&#xe5;llas i Ramallah den 20 till den 22 september 2016. 
De inbjudna partnerorganisationer arbetar med fr&#xe5;gor s&#xe5; som j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet, m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och kultur. Inom ramen av utbildningen finns en inbyggd komponent f&#xf6;r r&#xe5;dgivning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Consulate General of Sweden in Jerusalem plans to undertake a seminar on Outcome Mapping in Ramallah, 20-22 September, 2016, with partner organisations working in human rights, culture and gender equality. A follow up advisory phase will be also provided to participating organisations, as part of the overall assignment.</narrative>
  </description>
